{"story":{"id":"site-ancient-battle-site","title":{"zh":"古战场遗址","en":"Ancient Battle Site"},"category":"precursors","kind":"site","image":"art/26a20ed1dc121a360d63.webp","start":"archaeological_site_types:ancient_battle_site","chapters":3,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"对[From.Planet.GetName]的扫描显示，在该地区存在大量的有加工痕迹的物品以及零零散散的放射性物质，但从轨道上看不到什么细节。为了了解更多信息，我们需要着陆进行实地调查。","en":"Scans of [From.Planet.GetName] have revealed an area with packed with refined material and scattered radiologicals, although little is visible from orbit. To find out more we will need to investigate the site on the ground."},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"C2 precursor review (resumed, Claude)","scope":{"zh":"整条故事：遗址的出现方式、全部阶段（按定义顺序）、最后结果及其互斥关系、掷骰失败时的事件池；中英文正文已读。","en":"Whole story: how the site appears, every stage in definition order, the final outcome(s) and their exclusivity, the roll-failure incident pool; both languages read."},"sources":["common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt","localisation/simp_chinese","localisation/english"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/site-ancient-battle-site.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"archaeological_site_types:ancient_battle_site","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"ancrel.108","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"kind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1694"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"ancrel.109","parent":"n2","via":{"kind":"stage","hooks":["stage"],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"archaeological_site_types:ancient_battle_site","kind":"site","title":{"zh":"古战场遗址","en":"Ancient Battle Site"},"texts":[{"zh":"对[From.Planet.GetName]的扫描显示，在该地区存在大量的有加工痕迹的物品以及零零散散的放射性物质，但从轨道上看不到什么细节。为了了解更多信息，我们需要着陆进行实地调查。","en":"Scans of [From.Planet.GetName] have revealed an area with packed with refined material and scattered radiologicals, although little is visible from orbit. To find out more we will need to investigate the site on the ground."}],"sections":[{"zh":"对[From.Planet.GetName]的扫描显示，在该地区存在大量的有加工痕迹的物品以及零零散散的放射性物质，但从轨道上看不到什么细节。为了了解更多信息，我们需要着陆进行实地调查。","en":"Scans of [From.Planet.GetName] have revealed an area with packed with refined material and scattered radiologicals, although little is visible from orbit. To find out more we will need to investigate the site on the ground."}],"image":"art/26a20ed1dc121a360d63.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.108","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1694","hooks":["stage:","stage_event"],"story":"site-ancient-battle-site"},{"target":"ancrel.8000","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0002,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:2","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8001","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:3","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8002","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:4","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8003","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0011,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:5","hooks":["on_roll_faile