haeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.8110","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:37","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"federations2.701","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:51","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"event-federations2-701"},{"target":"ancrel.4078","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0018,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:64","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.13030","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0035,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:71","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.4006","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:90","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"ancrel.4021","kind":"failure","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"failure","chance":0.0071,"group":"r29659","modified":true,"source":"common/scripted_effects/archaeology_event_effects.txt:104","hooks":["on_roll_failed"],"story":"archaeology-incidents"},{"target":"story.5","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1680","story":"origin_fear_of_the_dark"}],"source":{"file":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","line":1667},"names":{"From.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}},"notes":[{"zh":"勘察天体时，隐藏事件 ancrel.9999（on_survey_planet）以 5/405 的机会生成一个随机考古遗址（AI帝国或5年内刚发现过遗址者机会×0.2），再按各遗址的权重抽取；本遗址要求拥有《远古遗物》，权重100，出现在可居住星球上。全银河最多一处。","en":"When a body is surveyed, hidden ancrel.9999 (on_survey_planet) has a 5/405 chance to create a random dig site (×0.2 for AI empires or if a site was found in the last 5 years), then picks a site type by weight; this site needs Ancient Relics and has weight 100 on habitable planets. At most one per galaxy.","kind":"review"}]},{"id":"ancrel.108","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"古战场遗址","en":"Ancient Battle Site"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们发现了被精炼过的矿物，虽然进一步研究亟待展开，但是我们初步认为这是一个巨型战场遗址。看起来，其中一方进行了轨道空降并与星球上的防御军发生了交火。进攻方为什么没有进行轨道轰炸？最后的胜利者究竟是谁？一切都悬而未决。","en":"The refined material has been uncovered, and while further study is needed, our initial impression is that this is the remains of a vast battle site. It appears that one side descended from orbit and was engaged by planetbound defenders. Why there was no orbital bombardment and who the victor was remains unclear."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b82ccadbb11e902954ad.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"CURIOUS","label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"ancrel.109","kind":"stage","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"stage","source":"common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt","hooks":["stage"],"story":"site-ancient-battle-site"}],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":1067}},{"id":"ancrel.109","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"被遗忘的怨恨","en":"Forgotten Grudge"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们得出结论，来自“毁灭者”，即一族高维游牧民的军队入侵了[From.Planet.GetName]，入侵时此行星属于“抵抗组织”，一个由数个不同物种组成的联盟。通过零散的记录，我们认定这场战争主要是在星系的其他部分进行，而[From.Planet.GetName]是抵抗组织寄希望于在“毁灭者”的魔爪之外建立一个秘密殖民地的尝试。这场战役和战争整体的结果仍不得而知，但对战争机器残骸的研究已经获得了一些有价值的信息。","en":"We have concluded that forces from \"The Destroyers\", a race of extra-dimensional nomads, invaded [From.Planet.GetName], which at the time belonged to \"Those-who-resist\", a coalition of several different species. From scattered records we believe that that the war was mostly fought elsewhere in the galaxy and [From.Planet.GetName] was an attempt by Those-who-resist to establish a secret colony outside the reach of The Destroyers. The outcome of this battle and the larger war remains unknown, but study of the wrecked war machines has yielded some valuable information."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/9dd0e3e6ffcf359310be.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":1092},"names":{"From.Planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}}],"summary":{"text":"# 古战场遗址 / Ancient Battle Site\n\n- 分类 Category：先驱者与考古 Precursors · 来源 Sources：common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1667；events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt:1068 · DLC：《远古遗物》Ancient Relics · 审阅 Reviewed 2026-10-13\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\n勘察天体时，隐藏事件 ancrel.9999（on_survey_planet）以 5/405 的机会生成一个随机考古遗址（AI帝国或5年内刚发现过遗址者机会×0.2），再按各遗址的权重抽取；本遗址要求拥有《远古遗物》，权重100，出现在可居住星球上。全银河最多一处。\n\nWhen a body is surveyed, hidden ancrel.9999 (on_survey_planet) has a 5/405 chance to create a random dig site (×0.2 for AI empires or if a site was found in the last 5 years), then picks a site type by weight; this site needs Ancient Relics and has weight 100 on habitable planets. At most one per galaxy.\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\n星球上有精炼材料与放射性残留：来自“毁灭者”的跨维度游牧者曾入侵此地——这里原属“抗争者”联盟的秘密殖民地。\n\n1. 古战场遗址：一方从轨道降下、被地面守军迎击的战场（社会学研究、小型文物）\n2. 被遗忘的怨恨：毁灭者与抗争者的战争，战果不明（三类研究奖励、中型文物）\n\nRefined material and radiation mark a battle site: extra-dimensional nomads, \"The Destroyers\", invaded a secret colony of the coalition \"Those-who-resist\".\n\n1. Ancient Battle Site: one side descended from orbit and met planetary defenders (society research, small artifact)\n2. Forgotten Grudge: the Destroyers against Those-who-resist; the outcome is unknown (all three research rewards, medium artifact)\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n- 无特殊的文明差异。 / No empire-specific variants beyond the reward wording.\n- 掷骰失败时使用通用事件池 all_random_events（见“考古遗址：发掘意外”）。 / Failed rolls use the generic pool all_random_events (see \"Archaeological Sites: excavation incidents\").\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已核对：遗址定义（common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1667）的阶段顺序与条件、各阶段事件脚本、出现方式；中英文正文已读。\n- Checked: the site definition (common/archaeological_site_types/02_ancient_relics_arc_sites.txt:1667) with its stage order and conditions, every stage event script, and how the site appears; both languages read.\n","path":"summaries/site-ancient-battle-site.md"}}